+\section{siOFF: A reimplemented siRNA Off-Target assessment pipeline}\label{sec:pipeline}
+Alongside the new version of RIsearch, we distribute \textbf{siOFF}, a complete reimplementation of the siRNA off-target pipeline introduced by \citet{alkan2017risearch2} (\cref{fig:summary}).
+Beyond porting the workflow from the end-of-life Python~2.7 to Python~3, the rewrite dismantles the concrete obstacles that limited adoption of the original pipeline: an installation that required a hand-compiled RIsearch2 binary and two external executables, a rigid single-script interface with a fixed set of flags, and subprocess-and-file coupling that prevented embedding in larger analyses.
+The underlying four-stage thermodynamic model---search, annotation intersection, accessibility, and a per-siRNA Boltzmann partition function---is preserved unchanged and described in full in \ref*{supp-sec:pipeline-stages}.
